    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_1210.variants.er80_correction :\n  answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ n m : ℕ, n < m →\n      ∑ q ∈ (Ioc n m).filter Prime, (1 / ((q : ℝ) - n)) <\n      (∑ p ∈ (range (m - n)).filter Prime, (1 / (p : ℝ))) + C",
